<title>SWEDEN: Avesta Sheffied 96/97 swings to loss.</title>
<headline>Avesta Sheffied 96/97 swings to loss.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to March 31, 1997,</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Pre-tax result		   LOSS     124 vs   3,598 PROFIT</p>
